C*******************************************************************************
C                          File Description
C
C   This data file contains the parameters and data file names for the simulation
C   of aquifer subsidence.
C
C*******************************************************************************
C                   Input and Output Data File Names
C
C   INISUBFL  ;  Initial conditions input file for interbed thickness and pre-compaction 
C                 head (max. 1000 characters)
C                 * Leave blank if these parameters are defined below
C                 * If the file is specified, the initial conditions will over-write
C                    interbed thickness and pre-compaction head defined below
C   TPSOUTFL  ;  TecPlot output file for subsidence (max. 1000 characters)
C                 * Leave blank if this output is not required
C   FNSUBFL   ;  Output file for end-of-simulation interbed thicknesses and pre-compaction 
C                 heads (max. 1000 characters)
C                 * Leave blank if this output is not required
C   FACTLTOU  ;  Factor to convert simulation unit of subsidence into intented output unit 
C   UNITLTOU  ;  Output unit of subsidence (max. 10 characters)
C
C----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C    VALUE                                        DESCRIPTION
C----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  / INISUBFL
    / ..\Results\C2VSimCG_Subsidence_TecPlot.out   / TPSOUTFL
                                                  / FNSUBFL
     1.0                                          / FACTLTOU
     FEET                                         / UNITLTOU
C*******************************************************************************
C                          Subsidence Output Data
C
C   The following lists the node and layer numbers for which subsidence data
C   will be printed
C
C   NOUTS      ; Total number of subsidence data to be printed 
C                 (NOUTS = 0 if no subsidence data is to be printed)
C   FACTXY     ; Conversion factor for nodal coordinates of the subsidence data 
C                 location if given in x-y coordinates
C   SUBHYDOUTFL; File name for subsidence data output (max. 1000 characters) 
C                 * Leave blank if this output is not required
C
C-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C   VALUE                                       DESCRIPTION
C-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    608                                         / NOUTS
    3.2808                                      / FACTXY
